# Model checkpoints and run outputs. The two run trees are listed as globs
# rather than as directories so the recorded GPU environment can be excepted:
# git does not descend into an excluded directory, so a negation inside one
# never takes effect. That one file is the provenance the manuscript cites for
# every reported AUROC, and it holds package versions and a GPU model only.
runs/*
!runs/gpu_environment.txt
runs_gpu/*
!runs_gpu/gpu_environment.txt
runs_smoke/
runs_frozen/
.venv-gpu/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt

