# superseded drafts, work-package outlines).
docs/*
!docs/ADNI_LABEL_ONTOLOGY.md
!docs/DATA_ACCESS.md
!docs/GPU_RUNBOOK.md
!docs/MANIFEST_SPEC.md
docs/reviews/

